rcia","role":"Nadia","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mUEEqXAGhrHa6X8UsDRfup4ZacV.jpg"},{"id":1904067,"name":"Frédéric Deleersnyder","role":"chauffeur uber","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iCTpS9m0JtSzoIv5E5tgfcUufoc.jpg"},{"id":1075115,"name":"Bastien Ughetto","role":"Steph","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6zeyplgO0ijOXrJ3KwAEdfT4AlS.jpg"},{"id":1374135,"name":"Wilfried Capet","role":"Sofiane","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rkVYjqgG32oWZhNKI74WdJS6UCp.jpg"},{"id":129765,"name":"Jonathan Cohen","role":"Gianni","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/T7ucGNWUDsRRXrjjVfY3uhPfMq.jpg"},{"id":1841421,"name":"Yasin Houicha","role":"Rayane","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8cp3QDOqNBxTrnNzsuPYEuMnTdS.jpg"},{"id":1744894,"name":"Alice Dufour","role":"Chloé","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6IIxIwQ4CLFZeQV6jvrAfCHtGQT.jpg"},{"id":586757,"name":"Adèle Exarchopoulos","role":"Vendeuse maquillage","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5I98lvcCH7T6KlTp9pqupMXa4Pi.jpg"},{"id":2172564,"name":"Hovnatan Avédikian","role":"L'homme qui déménage","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vKhzqSyyVWgmETkbw0M3p3zMTtD.jpg"},{"id":3412570,"name":"Florent Pinget","role":"Hipster barman"},{"id":1650365,"name":"Lionel Lingelser","role":"Nicolas, le docteur","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wQGwD1Ifu84K1BkmYVdHFEumo3S.jpg"},{"id":1857656,"name":"Oussama Kheddam","role":"Farid","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/a0mdYea9y28sXhOdmRsdg9GMg8b.jpg"},{"id":1362693,"name":"Yilin Yang","role":"Michèle","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/s5NPAywEWMxRXbtioC12jJ8C9HV.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","overview":"L’importante è essere se stessi ma per Nour, una giovane con venti chili di troppo, è più complicato del previsto dal momento che nessun ragazzo sembra notarla. Determinata a conquistare un uomo, trova una soluzione originale: la pole dance. Con l’aiuto di un’insegnante piuttosto speciale e delle sue due migliori amiche, Nour cercherà soprattutto di imparare ad accettare se stessa…"},{"language":"en-US","title":"Ballsy Girl","overview":"Nour is a pleasant and funny person who works as an accountant at a fitness center in Paris. Everybody likes her, but she has no luck in her romantic endeavours because she is overweight with atypical looks. Her close friends try to give her advice, but they are not particularly successful in the love department either. Her mother and brother are also close, but they are of no help, rather the contrary. One day she witnesses a pole dancing class at her workplace, something that she would never dream of doing herself, but she sees how much the women in the class and their teacher are enjoying themselves, so she is tempted. Finally the teacher starts giving her private lessons since she is too ashamed of her body to do anything in public. Slowly but surely she gains confidence in herself and many things change in her life."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Nour, une petite grosse de 25 ans qui ne semble être une option pour aucun mec, décide d’apprendre la féminité et la séduction en se mettant... au pole dance. Sissi, ancienne danseuse un peu bancale, va tenter de lui enseigner les bases de cette danse, mais aussi de l'acceptation de soi. Avec ses deux meilleurs amis tout aussi paumés qu’elle, Nour va filer droit dans le mur, avant d’apprendre enfin à s’aimer.","tagline":"Vous n'êtes pas prêts. Elle non plus."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ow6wuveiqHIsSUoj3hgkxUZs9FL.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rxX1ahiENShUJTUmUQRkXGYer2n.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":613368,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates